cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HEARS-LM v2.0: hearing-loss-adapted protein language model for missense variant interpretation"
abstract: >
  HEARS-LM fine-tunes ESM-2 with low-rank adapters on the proteins of the
  163 genes of the Genomics England PanelApp hearing-loss panel and combines
  it with whole-protein log-probabilities, conservation, structural annotation
  and gene-level descriptors, without allele frequency. Its score is
  calibrated to ACMG/AMP evidence strengths (PP3/BP4). The release contains
  the code, the labelled benchmark with provenance, the trained models,
  the result tables and precomputed scores.
